#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:143
msgid "Dark Mode Support"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:144
msgid "Add a dark mode toggle to provide users with a comfortable viewing experience in low-light environments. This feature will include automatic theme switching based on system preferences and a manual toggle in the user interface."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:152
msgid "Mobile App Development"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:153
msgid "Develop native mobile applications for iOS and Android platforms. The apps will provide core functionality with offline support and push notifications for important updates."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:160
msgid "Advanced Search Filters"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:161
msgid "Implement advanced search capabilities with filters for date ranges, categories, tags, and custom fields. Include saved search functionality for frequently used queries."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:169
msgid "Performance Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:170
msgid "Optimize database queries and implement caching strategies to improve page load times. Target is to achieve 50% faster load times for large datasets."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:178
msgid "Email Notification System"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:179
msgid "Build a comprehensive email notification system that allows users to subscribe to updates for specific items or categories. Include customizable email templates and frequency settings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:186
msgid "Fix Export Function Memory Issue"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:187
msgid "Resolve the memory exhaustion error that occurs when exporting large datasets. Implement chunked processing to handle exports of any size."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:194
msgid "API Rate Limiting"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:195
msgid "Implement rate limiting for API endpoints to prevent abuse and ensure fair usage. Include configurable limits per user and IP address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:202
msgid "Multi-language Support"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:203
msgid "Add full internationalization support with translations for major languages. Include RTL language support and locale-specific formatting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:210
msgid "Dashboard Widgets"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:211
msgid "Create customizable dashboard widgets showing roadmap statistics, recent updates, and voting trends. Allow users to arrange and configure widgets to their preference."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:218
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:219
msgid "Implement automated backup functionality with scheduled backups and one-click restore options. Include selective backup for specific data types."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:226
msgid "Social Media Integration"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-roadmap-demo-import.php:227
msgid "Add social media sharing capabilities and integration with major platforms. Allow users to share roadmap items and updates on Twitter, LinkedIn, and Facebook."
msgstr ""

